{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Re:Call",
    "steam_appid": 3855000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/ee1a811528bcb5ee5acadfdb0584a7ac.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=889 /></span><br><br><strong>Some memories are so precious that the heart hides them, even from ourselves. </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/e65701e991d3c6dc9cdbf07ab49efbda.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>When Kaito encounters four girls at his school - the energetic Hikari, the gentle Aya, the confident Kaori, and the mysterious Mio - he experiences an inexplicable sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. Their faces feel familiar, their voices echo in his mind, but he can't remember ever meeting them before. <br><br>Explore multiple story paths where your choices shape Kaito\u2019s bonds with each character, leading to unique endings that reveal hidden truths. Dive into a heartfelt narrative about memory, friendship, and the ties that bind us. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/62e9c9022a7524f69c870a6d3af21b97.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RE:Call is a single-player visual novel with beautiful anime-inspired artwork and a deeply emotional story. Experience a touching journey that invites you to remember what was meant to be forgotten. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/ee1a811528bcb5ee5acadfdb0584a7ac.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=889 /></span><br><br><strong>Some memories are so precious that the heart hides them, even from ourselves. </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/e65701e991d3c6dc9cdbf07ab49efbda.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>When Kaito encounters four girls at his school - the energetic Hikari, the gentle Aya, the confident Kaori, and the mysterious Mio - he experiences an inexplicable sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. Their faces feel familiar, their voices echo in his mind, but he can't remember ever meeting them before. <br><br>Explore multiple story paths where your choices shape Kaito\u2019s bonds with each character, leading to unique endings that reveal hidden truths. Dive into a heartfelt narrative about memory, friendship, and the ties that bind us. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855000/extras/62e9c9022a7524f69c870a6d3af21b97.avif?t=1754668668\" width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RE:Call is a single-player visual novel with beautiful anime-inspired artwork and a deeply emotional story. Experience a touching journey that invites you to remember what was meant to be forgotten. </p>",
    "short_description": "Re:Call is a deeply emotional visual novel exploring the fragile nature of memory, the weight of forgotten promises, and the healing power of friendship. Set in a nostalgic Japanese high school, it follows Kaito Nakamura as he learns his ordinary life\u2019s built on fragments of a past he can\u2019t remember",
